  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Technical Cooperation Facility (TCF I) under the 11th EDF Regional Indicative Programme for West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Technical Cooperation Facility (TCF) is designed to facilitate the implementation of the 11th EDF Regional Indicative Programme (RIP) for West Africa, and will be used for the identification and formulation of development actions financed by the EU in the region and to support the participation of representatives of the two Duly Mandated Regional Organisations (DMROs) for West Africa region, the Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS) and the West African Economic and Monetary Un</narrative>
